Here's a Python code example using pandas library to perform this analysis:

```python
# Assuming df is your DataFrame after data transformation
on_time_departures = df[(df['act_dep_time'] > df['sched_dep_time']) & (pd.notna(df['act_dep_time'])) & (pd.notna(df['sched_dep_time']))]

# Calculate on-time percentage for each airline
